          <article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" data-target="12" data-suffix="M">0</div><p>People Helped</p></article>
          <article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" data-target="50" data-suffix="K">0</div><p>Volunteers</p></article>
          <article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" data-target="190" data-suffix="">0</div><p>Countries Served</p></article>
          <article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" data-target="850" data-prefix="$" data-suffix="M">0</div><p>Raised for Aid</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="programs">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Programs &amp; Services</h2>
        <div class="accordion" id="programAccordion">
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-btn" aria-expanded="false">Disaster Relief <span>+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content"><p>Emergency shelter, food, water, and immediate support for communities impacted by hurricanes, floods, wildfires, and earthquakes.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-btn" aria-expanded="false">Blood Donation <span>+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content"><p>Nationwide blood drives and partnerships with medical centers to keep lifesaving blood supplies available during routine and crisis periods.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-btn" aria-expanded="false">Emergency Preparedness <span>+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content"><p>Community workshops and school programs that help families prepare, respond, and recover from emergencies before disaster strikes.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-btn" aria-expanded="false">International Humanitarian Aid <span>+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content"><p>Cross-border response operations supporting displaced populations with healthcare, sanitation, shelter, and long-term recovery tools.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-btn" aria-expanded="false">Community Health <span>+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content"><p>Local services addressing public health access, chronic emergency needs, and resilient community care systems in high-risk regions.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="get-involved">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Get Involved</h2>
        <div class="cards-2">
          <article class="card"><h3>Volunteer With Us</h3><p>Join 50,000+ volunteers helping communities prepare for, respond to, and recover from disasters.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Explore Volunteer Roles</a></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>Partner as an Organization</h3><p>Support resilient communities through corporate giving, in-kind donations, and local chapter partnerships.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Start a Partnership</a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="news">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Latest News</h2>
        <div class="carousel" aria-label="Latest News Carousel">
          <div class="carousel-track" id="newsTrack">
            <article class="news-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542831371-29b0f74f9713?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Relief convoy and volunteers delivering emergency supplies after a hurricane." />
              <div class="content"><h3>Hurricane Response Update</h3><p>Teams deployed to coastal communities with mobile shelters, clean water systems, and emergency medical kits.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article class="news-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475776408506-9a5371e7a068?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Volunteers supporting families affected by wildfire smoke and displacement." />
              <div class="content"><h3>Wildfire Relief Efforts</h3><p>Rapid-response hubs now operating across affected zones with respiratory care, family reunification, and logistics support.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article class="news-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511174511562-5f7f18b874f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Community members participating in a city blood donation campaign." />
              <div class="content"><h3>Blood Drive Campaign</h3><p>Our nationwide initiative increased donor appointments and expanded emergency reserve capacity for partner hospitals.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article class="news-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Volunteer spotlight portrait with local response team in a neighborhood recovery center." />
